# Steamvent Harbour (CIPlay steamvent_harbour): the quay, the notice, the machete's plans, the greenhouse vines, the
# gardener's log, the boiler house, the rats in the pipe store, the vent valve (steam), the town hall locker, the minutes.
island Steamvent Harbour
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -24.2; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 24.2
expect step 0
expect title The Warm Harbour
expect hidden steamhouses
zone quay
expect step 1
read Harbour master's notice
expect step 2
open Harbour store
wait 3
expect step 3
expect item Machete 1
use greenvines
expect hidden greenvines
zone greenhouse
expect step 4
open Greenhouse store
expect item Seed_Banana 2
read Gardener's log
expect step 5
open Boiler house
wait 3
expect step 6
open Steam-house locker
expect message frozen
zone pipestore
kill Rat
expect step 7
open Pipe store
wait 3
# REDO 10-24: the three handwheel pieces (greenhouse, boiler house, pipe store) are held - that step passes at once
expect story wheelpiece 3
expect step 9
# DEEP 10-24: the vent wants its relief valve - the cave, the masts (M25), the bathhouse hub, the derrick
use ventvalve
expect message relief valve
expect story steam 0
zone steam_cave
read Driller's warning
expect step 10
use bathhub
expect message four empty clamps
zone mast_ridge
open Ridge mast's cable box
zone mast_ne
open North-east mast's cable box
expect story cable 4
zone derrick_top
open Derrick valve housing
expect message clamped shut
use bathhub
expect story bathpower 1
expect story cable 0
expect hidden bathdoor
expect step 11
zone bathhouse
read A note for the bath keeper
read A QSL card
expect step 12
zone derrick_top
read The derrick
open Derrick valve housing
wait 3
expect story relief 1
expect step 13
use ventvalve
expect story steam 1
expect story wheelpiece 0
expect story relief 0
expect shown steamhouses
expect step 14
use ventvalve
expect message is open
open Steam-house locker
wait 3
expect step 15
read The Warden's broadcast
expect step 16
read Town meeting minutes
expect done
# the extras: the bathhouse, the east mast + the greenhouse hub, the driller's kit, the ruin, the ferry, two treasures
zone bathhouse
read Bath keeper's slate
open Bath keeper's locker
zone mast_east
open East mast's cable box
expect story cable 2
use greenhub
expect shown seeddrawer
open Seed drawer
open Driller's kit
read Pump keeper's ledger
zone ferry_basin
air ferryair
open Ferry's strongbox
dig 0
dig 1
